{"results":[{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/groups/288544190546353/posts/614145144652921/","final_url":"https://www.facebook.com/groups/288544190546353/posts/614145144652921/","title":"Democrats, Republicans and Independents for Democracy | ￼ it’s illegal to lie on television news in Canada | Facebook","description":"￼ it’s illegal to lie on television news in Canada. That’s why Fox News is not in Canada. 🇨🇦 ￼","language":"en","text":"￼ it’s illegal to lie on television news in Canada. That’s why Fox News is not in Canada. ￼\n\n### The Resistance\n\nAll reactions:\n\n1 comment\n\n1 share\n\nLike\n\nComment\n\nAll comments\n\n\n\nRichard Kennair\n\nNot quite correct.\n\nIn Canada the CRTC rule is basically that to be called news - it must be fair, balanced and factual. A “news” channel comes with perks - like having to be part of standard tv packages (which itself offers a funding base). …\n\nSee more\n\n1","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":2300.2932389936177,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}